<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ADRIAN MOLE: THE WILDERNESS YEARS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BOOK"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Adrian Mole: The Wilderness Years is the fourth book in the Adrian Mole series, focusing on the adult worries of Adrian Mole, published in 1993 by Methuen, set in 1991 to the first part of 1992, and covering themes similar to the first volumes."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WINSTON CHURCHILL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Winston Churchill is a historical figure known for his leadership during World War II and is the subject of Sir Martin Gilbert's biographies."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIR MARTIN GILBERT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sir Martin Gilbert is a person and the official biographer of Winston Churchill, having written multiple works including an eight-volume biography."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE WILDERNESS YEARS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Wilderness Years is a period in Winston Churchill's life, roughly corresponding to the decade from 1929 to 1939, where he was a backbencher."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHANCELLOR OF THE EXCHEQUER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chancellor of the Exchequer is a political position held by Winston Churchill before becoming a backbencher, indicating a period of active government service."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VOLUME FIVE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Volume five refers to a part of Sir Martin Gilbert's eight-volume biography of Winston Churchill."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1929 TO 1939&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1929 to 1939 is the time period during which The Wilderness Years occurred, spanning a decade in Winston Churchill's life."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BACKBENCHER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Backbencher is a political position held by Winston Churchill during The Wilderness Years, indicating a period of reduced political influence."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OFFICIAL BIOGRAPHER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Official biographer is the role held by Sir Martin Gilbert, responsible for writing detailed accounts of Winston Churchill's life."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;WINSTON CHURCHILL&quot;" target="&quot;SIR MARTIN GILBERT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sir Martin Gilbert is the official biographer of Winston Churchill, having written multiple works about him, including the eight-volume biography."&lt;SEP&gt;"Winston Churchill is the subject of Sir Martin Gilbert's biographies, which include the eight-volume work on his life."</data>
      <data key="d5">"biography, authorship"&lt;SEP&gt;"subject, biographical focus"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;WINSTON CHURCHILL&quot;" target="&quot;THE WILDERNESS YEARS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Wilderness Years is a period in Winston Churchill's life, described as the latter half of volume five of Sir Martin Gilbert's biography."</data>
      <data key="d5">"life period, biographical context"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;WINSTON CHURCHILL&quot;" target="&quot;CHANCELLOR OF THE EXCHEQUER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Winston Churchill held the position of Chancellor of the Exchequer before becoming a backbencher, indicating a period of active government service."</data>
      <data key="d5">"government service, career progression"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SIR MARTIN GILBERT&quot;" target="&quot;OFFICIAL BIOGRAPHER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Sir Martin Gilbert holds the role of official biographer, which involves writing detailed accounts of Winston Churchill's life."</data>
      <data key="d5">"authorship, role description"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE WILDERNESS YEARS&quot;" target="&quot;VOLUME FIVE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Wilderness Years corresponds to the latter half of volume five of Sir Martin Gilbert's biography, providing a specific timeframe for the events described."</data>
      <data key="d5">"timeframe, biographical detail"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE WILDERNESS YEARS&quot;" target="&quot;1929 TO 1939&quot;">
      <data key="d3">5.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Wilderness Years occurred during the time period from 1929 to 1939, which is a specific decade in Winston Churchill's life."</data>
      <data key="d5">"timeframe, historical context"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;THE WILDERNESS YEARS&quot;" target="&quot;BACKBENCHER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Wilderness Years is characterized by Winston Churchill holding the position of backbencher, indicating a period of reduced political influence."</data>
      <data key="d5">"political influence, historical period"</data>
      <data key="d6">ramdocs-0307-0c80672a6b42</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
